    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Praise God Who Satisfies 6"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A psalm of David. When he was in the Wilderness of Judah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, you are my God; I eagerly seek you.",
          "I thirst for you;",
          "my body faints for you",
          "in a land that is dry, desolate, and without water."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So I gaze on you in the sanctuary",
          "to see your strength and your glory."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My lips will glorify you",
          "because your faithful love is better than life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So I will bless you as long as I live;",
          "at your name, I will lift up my hands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You satisfy me as with rich food; ,",
          "my mouth will praise you with joyful lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When I think of you as I lie on my bed,",
          "I meditate on you during the night watches"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "because you are my helper;",
          "I will rejoice in the shadow of your wings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I follow close to you;",
          "your right hand holds on to me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But those who intend to destroy my life",
          "will go into the depths of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They will be given over to the power of the sword;",
          "they will become a meal for jackals."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But the king will rejoice in God;",
          "all who swear by him will boast,",
          "for the mouths of liars will be shut."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
